# Implementation Plan - Robust Error Logging and Full Test Suite

This plan outlines the enhancements to the application's error logging infrastructure and the expansion of the test suite to ensure full feature coverage and reliability.

## Proposed Changes

### Backend: Enhanced Logging

#### [MODIFY] [logging_utils.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/lib/logging_utils.py)
- Transition to structured logging (JSON format) for better machine readability in production.
- Add context-aware logging (e.g., request IDs, user IDs) using `contextvars`.
- Implement separate handlers for different log levels (e.g., `error.log` for ERROR/CRITICAL).

#### [MODIFY] [dependencies.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/dependencies.py)
- Integrate a middleware or dependency to inject request-scoped context (Request ID) into the logger.

---

### Frontend: Error Logging & Boundaries

#### [NEW] [ErrorBoundary.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/ErrorBoundary.tsx)
- Create a reusable React Error Boundary component to catch rendering errors and display a fallback UI.

#### [MODIFY] [layout.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/layout.tsx)
- Wrap the application in the `ErrorBoundary`.

#### [MODIFY] [api.ts](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/lib/api.ts)
- Enhance [apiFetch](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/lib/api.ts#7-35) to log errors to a centralized "frontend logs" endpoint or local console in a more structured way.

---

### Backend: Test Suite Expansion

#### [NEW] [test_canvas_service.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/tests/test_services/test_canvas_service.py)
- Add comprehensive tests for [canvas_sync.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/canvas_sync.py) including edge cases like token expiry and large course loads.

#### [NEW] [test_telegram_service.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/tests/test_services/test_telegram_service.py)
- Add unit tests for bot logic and user linking.

#### [MODIFY] [test_tasks.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/tests/test_routers/test_tasks.py)
- Expand coverage for the new `task_sync` features.

---

### Frontend: Test Suite Expansion

#### [NEW] [Dashboard.test.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/dashboard/__tests__/Dashboard.test.tsx)
- Add Vitest component tests for the main Dashboard widgets.

#### [MODIFY] [tasks.spec.ts](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/e2e/tasks.spec.ts)
- Expand Playwright E2E tests to cover complex task interactions (drag-and-drop, external sync).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- **Backend**: Run `pytest` from the `/backend` directory.
  ```bash
  cd backend && pytest
  ```
- **Frontend Unit/Component**: Run `vitest` from the `/frontend` directory.
  ```bash
  cd frontend && npm run test
  ```
- **Frontend E2E**: Run Playwright tests.
  ```bash
  cd frontend && npx playwright test
  ```

### Manual Verification
- Trigger a backend error (e.g., invalid data submission) and verify it appears in `backend/logs/backend.log` with structured context.
- Trigger a frontend crash and verify the `ErrorBoundary` displays the fallback UI.
